  "steps": [
    "Soak the chana dal in water for 1 hour, then drain and pressure-cook with turmeric, salt and 3 cups of water for 6 whistles until soft but not mushy.",
    "Heat the ghee in a wide pan and add cumin seeds and dried red chilli.",
    "Add the onion and cook until deep golden, then add the ginger garlic paste for 1 minute.",
    "Add the tomato, coriander powder and chilli powder and cook until the masala leaves the sides of the pan.",
    "Tip in the cooked dal with its liquid, and simmer for 10 minutes, mashing a few grains to thicken.",
    "Finish with garam masala, crushed dried fenugreek leaves and coriander leaves."
  ]
